  "goodToKnow": "Der Staatsbürger (die Staatsbürgerin) is a citizen of a country: deutscher Staatsbürger. Der Bürger on its own means citizen or townsperson, as in Bürgerinitiative (citizens' action group) and Bürgeramt (citizens' office). The Bundeswehr describes its ideal soldier as der Staatsbürger in Uniform, a citizen with rights and conscience, a lesson from the Wehrmacht. Die Staatsbürgerschaft is citizenship. Plural: die Staatsbürger."
